                    <details>This dataset was collected in October 2021, during commissioning of the Glacios microscope at the Department of Cell and Molecular Biology, Uppsala University. The sample is an asymmetric nucleosome (10-N-0, with 10 additional base pairs on the strong side of the Widom 601 nucleosome positioning sequence) that had been stored for more than a year at 4C at the time the grid was vitrified. A fraction of the nucleosomes in the dataset are partly unwrapped.

Gain-corrected movies from a Falcon 3EC camera, 0.952 A/pix, 40 frames, total dose 40.01 e/A2. The camera produced MRC files that were subsequently converted to tif format and compressed using relion_convert_to_tiff from Relion 3.1.3.</details>
                </journalCitation>
            </universalCitation>
        </citationList>
